**Cheapest safe scratch test**

Do not use the main VI as the first oracle. Create a disposable VI with three known constants?�e.g. I32 `12345`, DBL `3.25`, and string `hello`?�then demand exact type-and-value equality. LabVIEW?�s Terminal.Create Constant method creates a constant of the terminal?�s datatype and accepts an optional value, so the claim that the fleet ?�cannot create constants??is too strong; this is the cleanest headless fixture if that method is already reachable. [NI Terminal.Create Constant](https://www.ni.com/docs/en-AS/bundle/labview-api-ref/page/properties-and-methods/vi-server/generic/gobject/terminal/createconstant.html)

